:::dialect note
@office_us Low-context, direct-but-bounded register. Keep labels crisp, use periods instead of 'but', and confirm agreements in writing.
@personal_us Lead with warmth and accompaniment. Keep labels as witnessing rather than technique; honor consent to depth.
@rioplatense High-involvement warmth and sobremesa presence. Overlap often signals care, not interruption; pair clean boundaries with explicit relational warmth.
@espana Directness among peers is normal and not rude; friendship often builds through presence-first regularity (same café, lingering at the table) before heavy verbal disclosure.
:::
